<p>Actually, '叔母ちゃん、ありがとう” will do. When 'wa' is used as a particle, it is written as ’は’,<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-85077-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-85077-1')">1</a></sup> instead of 'わ/ワ’. I don't think a particle is needed since the SCP is directly addressing the agent.</p>
